<binaryimage arch="ARM:LE:32:Cortex">
<!--
    Three active registers that are not set up for the call they reach, each
    behind a run of forwarded registers that `passthrough`'s chain rule
    (kuna-passthrough-fwdchain.xml) lets through.  Each one anchored the run,
    so the forwarded registers became arguments too, and the function gained
    the parameters they read.

        s3g:  ...; ldr r3,[sp,#36]; eors.w ip,r3,ip; mov.w r3,#0;
              bne fail; add sp,#40; ldmia.w sp!,{r4,lr}; b.w g3
        fail: bl __stack_chk_fail
        tick: push {r3,lr}; ldr r3,=susp; ldr r3,[r3]; cbz r3,1f; ...
           1: ldmia.w sp!,{r3,lr}; b.w part
        fin:  vldr s14,[r0]; push {r3,lr}; vmov.f32 s15,s0;
              vldr s0,[r0,#4]; bl dur; vsub.f32 s15,s15,s14; ...

    from `long s3g(long a,long b,long c){ volatile char buf[32];
    buf[glob&31]=1; return g3(a,b,c); }` (-fstack-protector-strong),
    `unsigned tick(void){ if (!susp) return part(); pend++; hook(); return 0; }`
    and `static float dur(float d){ return d; }  int fin(struct traj *t,float
    x){ return x - t->t_begin >= dur(t->duration); }` (gcc 12 -O2 -mthumb
    -march=armv7e-m -mfloat-abi=hard -mfpu=fpv4-sp-d16).

    - s3g: the stack-protector epilogue wipes the canary register r3 with
      zero before the branch to __stack_chk_fail; that zero reached both calls
      and printed `__stack_chk_fail(a0,a1,a2,0)`.  A constant written in a
      block that ends in a branch whose other side makes a call is not set up
      for the call (kuna_passthrough.rs, set_before_branch).
    - tick: r3 is the alignment slot of `push {r3,lr}`, restored by the pop
      in front of the tail jump, and printed `part(a0,a1,a2,a3)` (FreeRTOS
      O2 xTaskIncrementTick has this shape).  A register reloaded from the
      frame does not anchor the run (has_frame_reload).
    - fin: gcc keeps s14 and s15 across the call to the local `bx lr`, which
      it knows clobbers nothing, and subtracts them after it; s1..s13 were the
      forwarded run, and the call printed fifteen invented float arguments
      (crazyflie O2-noinline piecewise_compressed_is_finished).  The call's
      INDIRECT on s14 creates a new value instead of reading the old one, and
      survives_call now counts any INDIRECT of the call on the trial's
      storage whose output the function reads.

    Stage / sub-stage: P4 "active-input-trial-scoring", option `passthrough`
    (kuna_passthrough.rs, anchors_neutral_run).  `g3` is `bx ip`, a tail jump
    the callee probe cannot see through, and `part` and `hook` are outside the
    image.  Both passes print what the option-off pass prints.
-->
